OL,4,CLeftover pumpkins help deliver 1,000th 
OL,5,Cfree meal                              
OL,6,GLeftover pumpkins have helped a        
OL,7,Gsustainable food organisation provide  
OL,8,Gits 1,000th free meal to low-income    
OL,9,Ghouseholds.                            
OL,11,FCambridge Sustainable Food started     
OL,12,Fproducing recipe kits earlier this     
OL,13,Fyear using fruit and vegetables that   
OL,14,Fwould have otherwise gone to waste.    
OL,16,FThe group received masses of pumpkins  
OL,17,Ffrom local farmers after Halloween,    
OL,18,Fincluding about 300kg (661lb) of them  
OL,19,Ffrom one supplier alone.               
